{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上瘋傳2段行車短片，直擊一輛貨車竟以不可思議的「頭直尾斜」姿態在馬路上奔馳。不論是日間在車速極快的屯門公路，抑或是晚間在繁忙的旺角彌敦道快線，該輛貨車全程維持車頭向前、車身側斜的角度行駛，遠看猶如一路飄移前進，怪異畫面令人目瞪口呆。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-14-14h38m11s628.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026hzTqKFj6VH1789368312.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-14-14h38m11s628.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段迅速在社交平台掀起洗版狂潮，大批網民紛紛發揮幽默本色留言熱議。有人笑言貨車「好明顯係慣性飄移」，亦有人打趣稱只是「瞓捩頸姐」；更有其他駕駛者紛紛附和表示曾目擊其蹤影：「呢架野喺東九龍繞道見過，以為佢飄移呢」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-14-14h38m19s589.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026771wWiFk0q1789368321.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-14-14h38m19s589.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">有專家針對片段進行分析，指出貨車異常偏移的根本原因，有可能是橫軸螺絲移位或鬆脫，令尾轆拉住輪胎殼的軸承鬆脫，導致右邊車輪整體向右移位。專家警告，車主若在橫軸螺絲鬆脫的情況下繼續強行開車，後果將不堪設想，一旦螺絲徹底脫落，行駛中的車輪極可能瞬間飛脫，令貨車瞬間失去平衡向右傾側，隨時翻車。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T08:21:14.828600+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":368,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}